@startuml
!include ../../theme.puml
title PDP：纯规则与耐久用例
skinparam linetype polyline
class PermissionDecisionEngine {
  decide(request)
  inspect(commandId)
}
class ProposalVerifier {
  prepare(action, trustedFacts)
}
class ActionAdapterRegistry {
  extractDemand(kind)
  verifyBinding(kind)
}
class PolicySnapshotLoader {
  loadFixed(policyRef)
}
class PolicyEvaluator {
  evaluate(PreparedDecision)
}
class ResourceIntersection {
  check(demand, ceilings)
}
class DecisionCommitter {
  commit(evaluation, versions)
}
interface SecurityUnitOfWork
class DecisionJournal
class PermitIssuer
class AskWriter
class AuditGate
PermissionDecisionEngine --> ProposalVerifier
ProposalVerifier --> ActionAdapterRegistry
PermissionDecisionEngine --> PolicySnapshotLoader
PermissionDecisionEngine --> PolicyEvaluator
PolicyEvaluator --> ResourceIntersection
PermissionDecisionEngine --> DecisionCommitter
DecisionCommitter --> SecurityUnitOfWork : T-D
DecisionCommitter --> DecisionJournal
DecisionCommitter --> PermitIssuer : allow
DecisionCommitter --> AskWriter : ask
PermissionDecisionEngine --> AuditGate : 交付前确认
note bottom of PolicyEvaluator
  冻结值输入，无 I/O
  deny → ceiling → ask → allow → default deny
end note
note bottom of SecurityUnitOfWork
  只读当前 Run 资格；写安全事实
  不写 ToolCall，不含外部调用
end note
@enduml
